[{"id":"ahsana-6-154-7","words":["verb:ahsana"],"options":[{"bs":"učinio je dobro","en":"he/it did good"},{"bs":"i učinili su dobro","en":"and they did good"},{"bs":"dobro rade","en":"they do well"},{"bs":"učinili ste dobro","en":"you (all) did good"}],"ref":"6:154","answerWord":"أَحْسَنَ","answerSound":"audio/f85ffc18c32b8cb80ee5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Again, We gave the Scripture unto Moses, complete for him who would do good, an explanation of all things, a guidance and a mercy, that they might believe in the meeting with their Lord.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti dobro, učiniti lijepim","en":"to do good, to do well"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","ءَاتَيْنَا","مُوسَى","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","تَمَامًا","عَلَى","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَحْسَنَ","وَتَفْصِيلًا","لِّكُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","وَهُدًى","وَرَحْمَةً","لَّعَلَّهُم","بِلِقَآءِ","رَبِّهِمْ","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْسَنَ"}},{"id":"ahsana-3-172-10","words":["verb:ahsana"],"options":[{"bs":"učinili su dobro","en":"they did good"},{"bs":"i čini dobro!","en":"and do good!"},{"bs":"činite dobro","en":"you (all) do good"},{"bs":"i učinio lijepim","en":"and made well"}],"ref":"3:172","answerWord":"أَحْسَنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/dbc377c5bf0c173db1c7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"As for those who heard the call of Allah and His messenger after the harm befell them (in the fight); for such of them as do right and ward off (evil), there is great reward.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti dobro, učiniti lijepim","en":"to do good, to do well"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱسْتَجَابُوا۟","لِلَّهِ","وَٱلرَّسُولِ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَآ","أَصَابَهُمُ","ٱلْقَرْحُ","لِلَّذِينَ","أَحْسَنُوا۟","مِنْهُمْ","وَٱتَّقَوْا۟","أَجْرٌ","عَظِيمٌ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْسَنَ"}},{"id":"ahsana-17-7-1","words":["verb:ahsana"],"options":[{"bs":"učinili ste dobro","en":"you (all) did good"},{"bs":"i činite dobro!","en":"and (you all) do good!"},{"bs":"i učinio lijepim","en":"and made well"},{"bs":"dobro rade","en":"they do well"}],"ref":"17:7","answerWord":"أَحْسَنتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/69c1f2efd8e59acd89bd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Saying): If ye do good, ye do good for your own souls, and if ye do evil, it is for them (in like manner). So, when the time for the second (of the judgments) came (We roused against you others of Our slaves) to ravage you, and to enter the Temple even as they entered it the first time, and to lay waste all that they conquered with an utter wasting.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti dobro, učiniti lijepim","en":"to do good, to do well"},"passage":["إِنْ","أَحْسَنتُمْ","أَحْسَنتُمْ","لِأَنفُسِكُمْ","وَإِنْ","أَسَأْتُمْ","فَلَهَا","فَإِذَا","جَآءَ","وَعْدُ","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","لِيَسُۥٓـُٔوا۟","وُجُوهَكُمْ","وَلِيَدْخُلُوا۟","ٱلْمَسْجِدَ","كَمَا","دَخَلُوهُ","أَوَّلَ","مَرَّةٍ","وَلِيُتَبِّرُوا۟","مَا","عَلَوْا۟","تَتْبِيرًا"],"marked":[1,2],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْسَنَ"}},{"id":"ahsana-64-3-5","words":["verb:ahsana"],"options":[{"bs":"i učinio lijepim","en":"and made well"},{"bs":"dobro rade","en":"they do well"},{"bs":"učinili su dobro","en":"they did good"},{"bs":"učinili ste dobro","en":"you (all) did good"}],"ref":"64:3","answerWord":"فَأَحْسَنَ","answerSound":"audio/72f5fdd4ddfee221cc53.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He created the heavens and the earth with truth, and He shaped you and made good your shapes, and unto Him is the journeying.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti dobro, učiniti lijepim","en":"to do good, to do well"},"passage":["خَلَقَ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضَ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","وَصَوَّرَكُمْ","فَأَحْسَنَ","صُوَرَكُمْ","وَإِلَيْهِ","ٱلْمَصِيرُ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْسَنَ"}},{"id":"ahsana-2-195-9","words":["verb:ahsana"],"options":[{"bs":"i činite dobro!","en":"and (you all) do good!"},{"bs":"i učinio lijepim","en":"and made well"},{"bs":"činite dobro","en":"you (all) do good"},{"bs":"učinili ste dobro","en":"you (all) did good"}],"ref":"2:195","answerWord":"وَأَحْسِنُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/8d064fa205e5ae406d96.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Spend your wealth for the cause of Allah, and be not cast by your own hands to ruin; and do good. Lo! Allah loveth the beneficent.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti dobro, učiniti lijepim","en":"to do good, to do well"},"passage":["وَأَنفِقُوا۟","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَلَا","تُلْقُوا۟","بِأَيْدِيكُمْ","إِلَى","ٱلتَّهْلُكَةِ","وَأَحْسِنُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْسَنَ"}},{"id":"ahsana-4-128-21","words":["verb:ahsana"],"options":[{"bs":"činite dobro","en":"you (all) do good"},{"bs":"dobro rade","en":"they do well"},{"bs":"i čini dobro!","en":"and do good!"},{"bs":"učinili ste dobro","en":"you (all) did good"}],"ref":"4:128","answerWord":"تُحْسِنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/a99f1dc6d0e52d89e3f0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If a woman feareth ill treatment from her husband, or desertion, it is no sin for them twain if they make terms of peace between themselves. Peace is better. But greed hath been made present in the minds (of men). If ye do good and keep from evil, lo! Allah is ever Informed of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti dobro, učiniti lijepim","en":"to do good, to do well"},"passage":["وَإِنِ","ٱمْرَأَةٌ","خَافَتْ","مِنۢ","بَعْلِهَا","نُشُوزًا","أَوْ","إِعْرَاضًا","فَلَا","جُنَاحَ","عَلَيْهِمَآ","أَن","يُصْلِحَا","بَيْنَهُمَا","صُلْحًا","وَٱلصُّلْحُ","خَيْرٌ","وَأُحْضِرَتِ","ٱلْأَنفُسُ","ٱلشُّحَّ","وَإِن","تُحْسِنُوا۟","وَتَتَّقُوا۟","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","كَانَ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ","خَبِيرًا"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْسَنَ"}},{"id":"ahsana-5-93-20","words":["verb:ahsana"],"options":[{"bs":"i učinili su dobro","en":"and they did good"},{"bs":"učinio je dobro","en":"he/it did good"},{"bs":"učinili ste dobro","en":"you (all) did good"},{"bs":"i čini dobro!","en":"and do good!"}],"ref":"5:93","answerWord":"وَّأَحْسَنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/e454bd4c9a10193e5051.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"There shall be no sin (imputed) unto those who believe and do good works for what they may have eaten (in the past). So be mindful of your duty (to Allah), and believe, and do good works; and again: be mindful of your duty, and believe; and once again: be mindful of your duty, and do right. Allah loveth the good.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti dobro, učiniti lijepim","en":"to do good, to do well"},"passage":["لَيْسَ","عَلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","جُنَاحٌ","فِيمَا","طَعِمُوٓا۟","إِذَا","مَا","ٱتَّقَوا۟","وَّءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","ثُمَّ","ٱتَّقَوا۟","وَّءَامَنُوا۟","ثُمَّ","ٱتَّقَوا۟","وَّأَحْسَنُوا۟","وَٱللَّهُ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْسَنَ"}},{"id":"ahsana-18-104-9","words":["verb:ahsana"],"options":[{"bs":"dobro rade","en":"they do well"},{"bs":"i činite dobro!","en":"and (you all) do good!"},{"bs":"učinio je dobro","en":"he/it did good"},{"bs":"učinili su dobro","en":"they did good"}],"ref":"18:104","answerWord":"يُحْسِنُونَ","answerSound":"audio/c7b1f91bdf44e39d22b9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those whose effort goeth astray in the life of the world, and yet they reckon that they do good work.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti dobro, učiniti lijepim","en":"to do good, to do well"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","ضَلَّ","سَعْيُهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَهُمْ","يَحْسَبُونَ","أَنَّهُمْ","يُحْسِنُونَ","صُنْعًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْسَنَ"}},{"id":"ahsana-28-77-11","words":["verb:ahsana"],"options":[{"bs":"i čini dobro!","en":"and do good!"},{"bs":"i učinio lijepim","en":"and made well"},{"bs":"učinili su dobro","en":"they did good"},{"bs":"dobro rade","en":"they do well"}],"ref":"28:77","answerWord":"وَأَحْسِن","answerSound":"audio/eb3d036b516831fc0197.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But seek the abode of the Hereafter in that which Allah hath given thee and neglect not thy portion of the world, and be thou kind even as Allah hath been kind to thee, and seek not corruption in the earth; lo! Allah loveth not corrupters,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"činiti dobro, učiniti lijepim","en":"to do good, to do well"},"passage":["وَٱبْتَغِ","فِيمَآ","ءَاتَىٰكَ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلدَّارَ","ٱلْءَاخِرَةَ","وَلَا","تَنسَ","نَصِيبَكَ","مِنَ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَأَحْسِن","كَمَآ","أَحْسَنَ","ٱللَّهُ","إِلَيْكَ","وَلَا","تَبْغِ","ٱلْفَسَادَ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"أَحْسَنَ"}},{"id":"bakhila-57-24-1","words":["verb:bakhila"],"options":[{"bs":"škrtare","en":"they are stingy"},{"bs":"škrtari","en":"he/it is stingy"},{"bs":"škrtarili su","en":"they were stingy"},{"bs":"škrtarili biste","en":"you would be stingy"}],"ref":"57:24","answerWord":"يَبْخَلُونَ","answerSound":"audio/de2568c2feaf0dd9fa52.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who hoard and who enjoin upon the people avarice. And whosoever turneth away, still Allah is the Absolute, the Owner of Praise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"škrtariti, biti škrt","en":"to be stingy"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يَبْخَلُونَ","وَيَأْمُرُونَ","ٱلنَّاسَ","بِٱلْبُخْلِ","وَمَن","يَتَوَلَّ","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","هُوَ","ٱلْغَنِىُّ","ٱلْحَمِيدُ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"بَخِلَ"}},{"id":"bakhila-9-76-4","words":["verb:bakhila"],"options":[{"bs":"škrtarili su","en":"they were stingy"},{"bs":"škrtari","en":"he/it is stingy"},{"bs":"škrtario je","en":"was stingy"},{"bs":"škrtare","en":"they are stingy"}],"ref":"9:76","answerWord":"بَخِلُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/783ceb29a9a8f24a04a6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Yet when He gave them of His bounty, they hoarded it and turned away, averse;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"škrtariti, biti škrt","en":"to be stingy"},"passage":["فَلَمَّآ","ءَاتَىٰهُم","مِّن","فَضْلِهِۦ","بَخِلُوا۟","بِهِۦ","وَتَوَلَّوا۟","وَّهُم","مُّعْرِضُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"بَخِلَ"}},{"id":"bakhila-47-38-9","words":["verb:bakhila"],"options":[{"bs":"škrtari","en":"he/it is stingy"},{"bs":"škrtarili su","en":"they were stingy"},{"bs":"škrtario je","en":"was stingy"},{"bs":"škrtare","en":"they are stingy"}],"ref":"47:38","answerWord":"يَبْخَلُ","answerSound":"audio/d5f6da584515c45c3de2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! ye are those who are called to spend in the way of Allah, yet among you there are some who hoard. And as for him who hoardeth, he hoardeth only from his soul. And Allah is the Rich, and ye are the poor. And if ye turn away He will exchange you for some other folk, and they will not be the likes of you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"škrtariti, biti škrt","en":"to be stingy"},"passage":["هَٰٓأَنتُمْ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","تُدْعَوْنَ","لِتُنفِقُوا۟","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","فَمِنكُم","مَّن","يَبْخَلُ","وَمَن","يَبْخَلْ","فَإِنَّمَا","يَبْخَلُ","عَن","نَّفْسِهِۦ","وَٱللَّهُ","ٱلْغَنِىُّ","وَأَنتُمُ","ٱلْفُقَرَآءُ","وَإِن","تَتَوَلَّوْا۟","يَسْتَبْدِلْ","قَوْمًا","غَيْرَكُمْ","ثُمَّ","لَا","يَكُونُوٓا۟","أَمْثَٰلَكُم"],"marked":[9,13],"facts":{"verb":"بَخِلَ"}},{"id":"bakhila-47-37-3","words":["verb:bakhila"],"options":[{"bs":"škrtarili biste","en":"you would be stingy"},{"bs":"škrtare","en":"they are stingy"},{"bs":"škrtari","en":"he/it is stingy"},{"bs":"škrtario je","en":"was stingy"}],"ref":"47:37","answerWord":"تَبْخَلُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/88ab59094b16260e2a97.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If He should ask it of you and importune you, ye would hoard it, and He would bring to light your (secret) hates.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"škrtariti, biti škrt","en":"to be stingy"},"passage":["إِن","يَسْـَٔلْكُمُوهَا","فَيُحْفِكُمْ","تَبْخَلُوا۟","وَيُخْرِجْ","أَضْغَٰنَكُمْ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"بَخِلَ"}},{"id":"bakhila-47-38-11","words":["verb:bakhila"],"options":[{"bs":"škrtari","en":"he/it is stingy"},{"bs":"škrtarili su","en":"they were stingy"},{"bs":"škrtarili biste","en":"you would be stingy"},{"bs":"škrtario je","en":"was stingy"}],"ref":"47:38","answerWord":"يَبْخَلْ","answerSound":"audio/f30803b4d0313ea276d1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! ye are those who are called to spend in the way of Allah, yet among you there are some who hoard. And as for him who hoardeth, he hoardeth only from his soul. And Allah is the Rich, and ye are the poor. And if ye turn away He will exchange you for some other folk, and they will not be the likes of you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"škrtariti, biti škrt","en":"to be stingy"},"passage":["هَٰٓأَنتُمْ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","تُدْعَوْنَ","لِتُنفِقُوا۟","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","فَمِنكُم","مَّن","يَبْخَلُ","وَمَن","يَبْخَلْ","فَإِنَّمَا","يَبْخَلُ","عَن","نَّفْسِهِۦ","وَٱللَّهُ","ٱلْغَنِىُّ","وَأَنتُمُ","ٱلْفُقَرَآءُ","وَإِن","تَتَوَلَّوْا۟","يَسْتَبْدِلْ","قَوْمًا","غَيْرَكُمْ","ثُمَّ","لَا","يَكُونُوٓا۟","أَمْثَٰلَكُم"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"بَخِلَ"}},{"id":"bakhila-92-8-2","words":["verb:bakhila"],"options":[{"bs":"škrtario je","en":"was stingy"},{"bs":"škrtarili su","en":"they were stingy"},{"bs":"škrtarili biste","en":"you would be stingy"},{"bs":"škrtare","en":"they are stingy"}],"ref":"92:8","answerWord":"بَخِلَ","answerSound":"audio/9876351ad6a3d5a2047b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But as for him who hoardeth and deemeth himself independent,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"škrtariti, biti škrt","en":"to be stingy"},"passage":["وَأَمَّا","مَنۢ","بَخِلَ","وَٱسْتَغْنَىٰ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"بَخِلَ"}}]